  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/toitlang/toit/zipball/v2.0.0-alpha.199",
  "body": "Fix persistent BLE value buffers.\r\nAdd verbose compiler statistics.\r\nHarden subprocess wait and signaling primitives.\r\nMerge UART and USB console input.\r\nAdd terminal control primitives.\r\nLSP utilization improvements.\r\nFix asynchronous RSA generation and enable it on ESP32-P4.\r\nReduce ESP32 TLS memory use with dynamic mbedTLS buffers.\r\nAdd asynchronous I2C/SPI target support.\r\nMigrate I2C/SPI controller operations to async.\r\nFix a GC segmentation fault.\r\nFix LSP rename range for nullable type annotations.\r\nDeprecate GPIO pins without an explicit direction.\r\nAdd EC618 platform support."
}
